{%- comment -%}
  Wander Way demo – text wordmark + "Demo" pill. The pill is always rendered so
  every page reads as a demo store.

  Accepts:
  - text: {String} wordmark text (falls back to shop.name)
  - badge: {String} pill text (falls back to "Demo")

  Usage:
  {% render 'ww-wordmark', text: section.settings.ww_wordmark, badge: section.settings.ww_badge_text %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="ww-wordmark">
  <span class="ww-wordmark__name">{{ text | default: shop.name | escape }}</span>
  <span class="ww-badge-demo">{{ badge | default: 'Demo' | escape }}</span>
</span>
